      "startPosition": 4777,
      "endPosition": 53882,
      "textStart": "From space it looks grey and crystalline, obliterating the blue-green colours of the living Earth. It is criss-crossed by irregular patterns and convergent striations.",
      "textEnd": "gradually builds up; in effect, a car park. To understand which one requires a lot of context and subtle interpretation. There are times when it feels as if metabolomics should just be called gnomics."
