      "endPosition": 141513,
      "textStart": "Burlington House, Piccadilly, 1932. Its stately Victorian façades are glittering with light at the fag-end of a particularly dismal November. A spry, silver-haired gentleman, immaculately dressed and moustachioed, is coming to the end of his anniversary address as President of the Royal Society of London.",
